The interoperability suite of lambda-twelve/one-record runs NE:ONE (opeN
sourcE: ONE record server software), unmodified, as a separate container, to
compare its answers with this package's.

NE:ONE is an initiative of the Digital Testbed Air Cargo (DTAC), funded by the
German Federal Ministry for Digital and Transport, published by the Open
Logistics Foundation:
  https://git.openlogisticsfoundation.org/wg-digitalaircargo/ne-one

It is licensed under the Open Logistics Foundation License 1.3, a copy of which
is included as NE-ONE-LICENSE-OLFL-1.3. This image is built from the upstream
source at the commit recorded in its org.opencontainers.image.revision label.
No NE:ONE file has been modified; all copyright, patent, trademark and
attribution notices of the upstream source are retained. No NE:ONE source is
part of lambda-twelve/one-record.
